  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Back to School Project 2023/2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Back to School project in Lebanon aims to address the impact of the economic crisis on education for refugees and host communities. Over a million students have already left education, and the numbers are expected to increase in the upcoming 2023-2024 school year. The project seeks to provide access to quality education, reduce dropouts, and foster a supportive learning environment, empowering vulnerable children and youth for a better future.</narrative>
  </description>
